  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "JIT help",
      "source_hash": 7254763807693352716,
      "context_hash": 7379461888752187174,
      "translation": "JIT 도움말",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:42:45.366807Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "this is from ``pypy --jit help``",
      "source_hash": 1648797789493831345,
      "context_hash": 8001273469089474120,
      "translation": "이 내용은 ``pypy --jit help``\\ 에서 가져온 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:43.817556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Advanced JIT options",
      "source_hash": 14188057926496228958,
      "context_hash": 8034995176456563695,
      "translation": "고급 JIT 옵션",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:22.227384Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "``<pypy> --jit`` [*options*] where *options* is a comma-separated list of ``OPTION=VALUE``:",
      "source_hash": 1630069198802600122,
      "context_hash": 1072003507045096876,
      "translation": "``<pypy> --jit`` [*options*] 형식으로 사용하며, 여기서 *options*\\ 는 ``OPTION=VALUE``\\ 를 쉼표로 구분한 목록입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:45.274882Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "decay=N",
      "source_hash": 15056778964322694859,
      "context_hash": 7913553260416858285,
      "translation": "decay=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:22.821185Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "amount to regularly decay counters by (0=none, 1000=max) (default 40).",
      "source_hash": 8545712257689323721,
      "context_hash": 4341109447727187931,
      "translation": "카운터를 주기적으로 감쇠시키는 양입니다(0=없음, 1000=최대)(기본값 40).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.753898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This value is used to reduce the JIT counters every 32 minor collections, according to the formula ``val *= 1.0 - (decay / 1000)``.",
      "source_hash": 2535344263451649817,
      "context_hash": 10540356209527287075,
      "translation": "이 값은 ``val *= 1.0 - (decay / 1000)`` 공식에 따라 마이너 컬렉션 32회마다 JIT 카운터를 줄이는 데 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.753900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "This avoids JIT compilation of rare paths even on long-running programs.",
      "source_hash": 9428391534213375090,
      "context_hash": 7997412241756726168,
      "translation": "이를 통해 오래 실행되는 프로그램에서도 드물게 실행되는 경로가 JIT 컴파일되지 않도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.753900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "disable_unrolling=N",
      "source_hash": 6358271231323716016,
      "context_hash": 11897921516027636472,
      "translation": "disable_unrolling=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:24.811088Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "after how many operations we should not unroll (default 200)",
      "source_hash": 17678783961215599375,
      "context_hash": 15227695205470376815,
      "translation": "몇 개의 연산 이후부터 언롤링하지 않을지 지정합니다(기본값 200)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.754535Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "enable_opts=N",
      "source_hash": 14975297120705863265,
      "context_hash": 16691729056110125739,
      "translation": "enable_opts=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:30.627098Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "INTERNAL USE ONLY (MAY NOT WORK OR LEAD TO CRASHES): optimizations to enable, or all = intbounds:rewrite:virtualize:string:pure:earlyforce:heap:unroll (default all)",
      "source_hash": 8303165764482540688,
      "context_hash": 4094230774630778599,
      "translation": "내부 전용(작동하지 않거나 크래시가 발생할 수 있습니다): 활성화할 최적화 또는 all을 지정합니다. all = intbounds:rewrite:virtualize:string:pure:earlyforce:heap:unroll입니다(기본값 all).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.754870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "function_threshold=N",
      "source_hash": 2125337334355522922,
      "context_hash": 1996396899588972051,
      "translation": "function_threshold=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:42:46.311826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "number of times a function must run for it to become traced from start (default 1619)",
      "source_hash": 16203197169792635853,
      "context_hash": 5018165230982732442,
      "translation": "함수가 시작부터 트레이싱되려면 실행되어야 하는 횟수(기본값 1619)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:53:56.755163Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "inlining=N",
      "source_hash": 3603807872501827144,
      "context_hash": 15035427750309670210,
      "translation": "inlining=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:34.731745Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "inline python functions or not (1/0) (default 1)",
      "source_hash": 1797053029364855211,
      "context_hash": 17052020271689048414,
      "translation": "파이썬 함수를 인라인할지 여부 (1/0) (기본값 1)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:54:13.381699Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "loop_longevity=N",
      "source_hash": 11583546659230128955,
      "context_hash": 7336251507370543206,
      "translation": "loop_longevity=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T23:43:36.286404Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "a parameter controlling how long loops will be kept before being freed, an estimate (default 1000)",
      "source_hash": 17053377836014564073,
      "context_hash": 15472313671893954381,
      "translation": "루프가 해제되기 전까지 얼마나 오래 유지될지를 제어하는 매개변수이며, 추정값입니다(기본값 1000).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:54:13.382449Z",
      "issues": [
        "The translation is accurate and readable, but \"매개변수이며, 추정값입니다\" is a bit clunky and makes the parameter itself sound like the estimate, when the source means the retention length is approximate (something like \"대략적인 값\" would be clearer)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
